@* Turkish e-commerce law (6563 art.3, regulation art.5, TTK art.39/2). Values come from LegalInfo (appsettings). *@
<p class="lede">The Booster Auth software, this website and the license portal are provided by the company below.</p>

<h2 id="company">Company details</h2>
<dl>
    <dt>Legal name</dt><dd>@Legal.CompanyName</dd>
    <dt>Company type</dt><dd>@Legal.CompanyTypeEn</dd>
    <dt>MERSIS number</dt><dd>@Legal.Mersis</dd>
    <dt>Trade registry</dt><dd>@Legal.TradeRegistry</dd>
    <dt>Tax office / number</dt><dd>@Legal.TaxOffice / @Legal.TaxNumber</dd>
    <dt>Registered address</dt><dd>@Legal.Address</dd>
    @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Legal.Trademark))
    {
        <dt>Trademark</dt><dd>Booster Auth, registration: @Legal.Trademark</dd>
    }
    <dt>Chamber membership</dt>
    <dd>@Legal.Chamber@if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Legal.ChamberRulesUrl)) {<text> · professional rules: @Legal.ChamberRulesUrl</text>}</dd>
</dl>

<h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
<dl>
    <dt>Registered e-mail (KEP)</dt><dd>@Legal.Kep</dd>
    <dt>E-mail</dt><dd>@Legal.Email</dd>
    <dt>Support</dt><dd><a href="mailto:@Legal.SupportEmail">@Legal.SupportEmail</a> · <a href="@Legal.PhoneHref">@Legal.Phone</a></dd>
    <dt>Data protection requests</dt><dd>@Legal.KvkkEmail (details: <a href="/en/legal/privacy#requests">Privacy Notice</a>)</dd>
</dl>
<p>Notices with legal effect, such as notices of default, termination or rescission, can be sent to our KEP address, through a notary public or by
    registered mail with return receipt to our registered address. E-mail is sufficient for all other correspondence.</p>

<h2 id="contract">How the contract is concluded</h2>
<p>License orders and trial licenses are placed in the <a href="/hesap">license portal</a>. The steps, how to correct your details, payment and
    delivery are described in the <a href="/en/legal/sales-terms">Sales and Order Terms</a>; the scope of your right of use is set out in the
    <a href="/en/legal/license-agreement">Software License Agreement</a>.</p>
<ul>
    <li>The contract language is Turkish. English texts are provided for information; in case of conflict the Turkish text prevails.</li>
    <li>The version of the text you accept is stored with your order and shown on the order page. You can view, print or save the texts as PDF from
        these pages at any time.</li>
    <li>We sell only to businesses, institutions and public bodies; we do not sell to consumers.</li>
    <li>Turkish law applies to disputes. For commercial disputes, applying to a mediator before filing a lawsuit is mandatory by law.</li>
</ul>
<p>How we process personal data is explained in the <a href="/en/legal/privacy">Privacy Notice</a>; cookies are described in the
    <a href="/en/legal/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
